00:04:14.653 --> 00:04:17.097 line:91%
<c.yellow>But at what cost?</c>
<c.cyan>At what cost?</c>

00:04:20.614 --> 00:04:23.662 line:85%
<c.cyan>You know what? <00:04:22.383><c>I'm gonna take it.</c></c><c.colorEEEEEE></c>

00:04:23.662 --> 00:04:26.168 line:85%
<c.cyan>I'm gonna do that for the team.</c>

00:04:26.168 --> 00:04:28.140 line:85%
Alright, your call.

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:30.001 line:91%
<c.yellow>There you are.</c>
<c.cyan>Yeah, my call.</c>

00:04:30.001 --> 00:04:33.428 position:59% line:91%
<c.yellow>But I'm not at a loss,
other than I would've got some tokens.</c>

00:04:33.428 --> 00:04:36.186 line:91%
<c.yellow>And then it would've vanished
beneath my 34. Gotcha.</c>

00:04:38.276 --> 00:04:39.896 line:91%
<c.yellow>I got greedy,
is what I'm trying to say.</c>

00:04:40.593 --> 00:04:42.100 line:85%
<c.cyan>Eh...</c>

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.088 line:91%
<c.cyan>I'm getting really thrown
