00:04:48.704 --> 00:04:50.965 line:91%
<c.green>"Still a great value!
Eleven is heaven!"</c>

00:04:50.965 --> 00:04:53.545 line:91%
<c.cyan>"Eleven is heaven," sure.
There we go.</c>

00:04:53.545 --> 00:04:55.784 line:91%
