I am really disappointed,</c>

00:04:55.784 --> 00:04:58.228 line:91%
<c.yellow>'cause getting sequential numbers
would've pleased me.</c>

00:04:58.228 --> 00:04:58.995 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah, yeah.</c>

00:04:58.995 --> 00:05:01.456 line:91%
