So let's see.
Oh god, right, yeah, no.

00:06:24.072 --> 00:06:26.058 line:91%
I'm gonna pass that.
28 can go on.

00:06:26.058 --> 00:06:28.391 line:85%
<c.yellow>28? Ohh, that's a perfect number.</c>

00:06:29.618 --> 00:06:30.693 line:85%
<c.green>How are you playing this game?</c>

