00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:46.156 line:85%
<c.yellow>I only know...</c>

00:07:46.156 --> 00:07:49.453 line:91%
<c.colorEEEEEE>I regret being the host of this!</c>
<c.yellow>...only know Tom's.</c>

00:07:49.453 --> 00:07:51.174 line:91%
<c.cyan>I just realized as well that
as I keep taking cards,</c>

00:07:51.174 --> 00:07:53.251 position:66% line:85%
<c.cyan>I can also stop you from getting counters.</c>

